---
// Proof-point stat band on ink.
---

<section class="cql-stats">
  <div class="cql-container cql-stats__grid">
    <div class="cql-stat">
      <div class="cql-stat__value">~4%</div>
      <div class="cql-stat__caption">
        average pricing error on a public API we don't run, using a 93-line adapter
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cql-stat cql-stat--accent">
      <div class="cql-stat__value">5 / 5</div>
      <div class="cql-stat__caption">
        test queries where the quoted ceiling was never below the real cost
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cql-stat">
      <div class="cql-stat__value">38.5×</div>
      <div class="cql-stat__caption">
        repeated work our test database merged into single calls: costQL saw it and priced it once
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
